Description: Machine learning platform (CPU build)
 TensorFlow is an end-to-end open source machine learning platform. This
 is the CPU-only build (no CUDA/GPU support).
 .
 This package repackages the official prebuilt PyPI wheel (~570MB;
 TensorFlow's own Bazel-based build is far outside the scope of a simple
 Debian packaging pipeline - Debian's own archive doesn't carry
 TensorFlow for this reason either). Packaged for the invokeai-mastodon
 project's local NSFW image classification (via opennsfw2's tf-keras
 backend), and requires the 'backports' component enabled for a
 sufficiently new python3-protobuf.
